{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cops N' Zombies is an intense multiplayer horror social-oriented/deduction game. You and your team are to investigate a desolate map while one of your teammates is secretly a Zombie. The zombie player can transform at will and must use this to their advantage to kill all the police. The police can also find weapons and kill who they think are the zombie. How will you figure out who's who and who to trust? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play with your friends or meet new people in different servers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the map and find different guns to kill your teammates or the zombie! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Zombie can strategize and can act like a player to betray people or transform into a stronger melee zombie!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Earn Money each round and buy different equipment, like this taser!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066000/extras/46c8fe50d03cbff4e2a6eca56fb7e260.poster.avif?t=1770673797\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066000/extras/46c8fe50d03cbff4e2a6eca56fb7e260.webm?t=1770673797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066000/extras/46c8fe50d03cbff4e2a6eca56fb7e260.mp4?t=1770673797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Voice chat to scream at your friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is still under development. Be sure to follow our Social Media for latest updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><